{"strongs": "H4578", "word": "מֵעֶה", "translit": "me.eh", "root": "מעה", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "internal organs, inward parts (intestines, bowels), belly", "definition": "[ מֵעֶה ] noun masculine Isa 16:11 only plural internal organs, inward parts (intestines, bowels), belly (Late Hebrew id. ; Aramaic מְעָא , מַעֲיָא , , ; Arabic ; Ethiopic ; — on form compare Lag BN 156 Ba ZMG xiii. 1888, 345 ); — plural [ מֵעִים ] construct מְעֵי Ps 71:6 + 3 t.; suffix מֵעַי 2Sam 16:11 + 9 t., מֵעָ֑י Ps 22:15 ; Ps 40:9 מֵעֶיךָ Gen 15:4 + 6 t.; מֵעַיִךְ Gen 25:23 ; Num 5:22 מֵעָיו 2Sam 20:10 + 5 t.; מֵעֵיהֶם Ezek 7:19 — 1. literally: \\ \\ a. וַיִּשְׁפֹּךְ מֵעָיו אַ֫רְצָה 2Sam 20:10 and he poured out his inward parts on the ground (through a wound); compare ׳ מַחֲלֵה מ 2Chr 21:15 ; 2Chr 21:18 , ׳ יָָֽצְאוּ מ v 2Chr 21:15 v 2Chr 21:19 . \\ \\ b. as digestive organs, but without precision, nearly = stomach , belly , Job 20:14 ; Ezek 3:3 (|| בֶּטֶן ), Ezek 7:19 (|| נֶפֶשׁ ; both with מָלֵא ), Num 5:22 so of fish that swallowed Jonah Jonah 2:1 ; Jonah 2:2 . 2. source of procreation: אשׁר יצא ׳ מִמּ (said of offspring) Gen 15:4 ( J E ), 2Sam 7:12 (|| זַרְעֲךָ ), 2Sam 16:11 ׳ צֶאֱצָאֵי מ Isa 48:19 (|| id. ); ׳ מִיצִיאֵי מ 2Chr 32:21 . 3. = womb , שְׁנֵי לְאֻמִּים מִמֵּעַיִח יִפָּרֵ֑דוּ Gen 25:23 ( J ; || בֶּטֶן ), compare Isa 49:1 (|| id. ), Ps 71:6 (|| id. ), Ruth 1:11 . 4. in general = inwards, inward part , ׳ לִבִּי ֗֗֗ נָמֵס בְּתוֺךְ מ Ps 22:15 , compare ׳ תּוֺרָֽתְךָ בְּתוֺךְ מ Ps 40:9 . 5. figurative = seat of emotions: pity, Isa 16:11 (|| קֶרֶב ); of God's compassion, Jer 31:20 (|| רחם ; in both subject of verb הָמוּ ); הֲמוֺן מֵעֶיךָ Isa 63:15 (|| רַחֲמֶיךָ ); distress, Jer 4:19 (twice in verse) (|| לֵב , מֵעַי חֳמַרְמָרוּ Lam 1:20 (|| לֵב ), Lam 2:11 (|| כָּבֵד liver ); מֵעַי רֻתְּחוּ Job 30:27 (dubious, see Bu ); love, מֵעַי הָמוּ עָלָיו Song 5:4 . 6. the external belly, מֵעָיו עֶשֶׁת שֵׁן Song 5:14 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4752')\">BDB4752</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4578')\">H4578</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4751')\">BDB4751</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4753')\">BDB4753</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>מֵעֶה</bdbheb>] <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Isa 16:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,16,11)\">Isa 16:11</ref></sup> only <b>plural</b> <highlightword>internal organs, inward parts (intestines, bowels), belly</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id.</highlight>; Aramaic <bdbarc>מְעָא</bdbarc>, <bdbheb>מַעֲיָא</bdbheb>, <placeholder3051/>, <placeholder3052/>; Arabic <placeholder3053/>; Ethiopic <placeholder3054/>; — on form compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Lag')\">Lag<sup>BN 156</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ba')\">Ba<sup>ZMG xiii. 1888, 345</sup></lookup>); — plural [<bdbheb>מֵעִים</bdbheb>] construct <bdbheb>מְעֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 71:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"71\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"71\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,71,6)\">Ps 71:6</ref> + 3 t.; suffix <bdbheb>מֵעַי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 16:11\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(10,16,11)\">2Sam 16:11</ref> + 9 t., <bdbheb>מֵעָ֑י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 22:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,22,15)\">Ps 22:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 40:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,40,9)\">Ps 40:9</ref> <bdbheb>מֵעֶיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 15:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,15,4)\">Gen 15:4</ref> + 6 t.; <bdbheb>מֵעַיִךְ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 25:23\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(1,25,23)\">Gen 25:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 5:22\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,22)\">Num 5:22</ref> <bdbheb>מֵעָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:10\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,10)\">2Sam 20:10</ref> + 5 t.; <bdbheb>מֵעֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 7:19\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(26,7,19)\">Ezek 7:19</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> literally: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <bdbheb>וַיִּשְׁפֹּךְ מֵעָיו אַ֫רְצָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 20:10\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(10,20,10)\">2Sam 20:10</ref> <highlight>and he poured out his inward parts on the ground</highlight> (through a wound); compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מַחֲלֵה מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 21:15\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(14,21,15)\">2Chr 21:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 21:18\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(14,21,18)\">2Chr 21:18</ref>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יָָֽצְאוּ מ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"2Chr 21:15\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(14,21,15)\">2Chr 21:15</ref> v<ref ref=\"2Chr 21:19\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(14,21,19)\">2Chr 21:19</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> as digestive organs, but without precision, nearly = <highlight>stomach</highlight>, <highlight>belly</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Job 20:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,20,14)\">Job 20:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 3:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,3,3)\">Ezek 3:3</ref> (|| <bdbheb>בֶּטֶן</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Ezek 7:19\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(26,7,19)\">Ezek 7:19</ref> (|| <bdbheb>נֶפֶשׁ</bdbheb>; both with <bdbheb>מָלֵא</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Num 5:22\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(4,5,22)\">Num 5:22</ref> so of fish that swallowed Jonah <ref ref=\"Jonah 2:1\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(32,2,1)\">Jonah 2:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jonah 2:2\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(32,2,2)\">Jonah 2:2</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> source of procreation: <bdbheb>אשׁר יצא</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִמּ</bdbheb> (said of offspring) <ref ref=\"Gen 15:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,15,4)\">Gen 15:4</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup><lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"2Sam 7:12\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(10,7,12)\">2Sam 7:12</ref> (|| <bdbheb>זַרְעֲךָ</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"2Sam 16:11\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(10,16,11)\">2Sam 16:11</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>צֶאֱצָאֵי מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 48:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"48\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"48\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,48,19)\">Isa 48:19</ref> (|| <highlight>id.</highlight>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִיצִיאֵי מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Chr 32:21\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(14,32,21)\">2Chr 32:21</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> = <highlight>womb</highlight>, <bdbheb>שְׁנֵי לְאֻמִּים מִמֵּעַיִח יִפָּרֵ֑דוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 25:23\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(1,25,23)\">Gen 25:23</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; || <bdbheb>בֶּטֶן</bdbheb>), compare <ref ref=\"Isa 49:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,49,1)\">Isa 49:1</ref> (|| <highlight>id.</highlight>), <ref ref=\"Ps 71:6\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"71\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"71\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(19,71,6)\">Ps 71:6</ref> (|| <highlight>id.</highlight>), <ref ref=\"Ruth 1:11\" b=\"8\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(8,1,11)\">Ruth 1:11</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> in general = <highlight>inwards, inward part</highlight>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>לִבִּי ֗֗֗ נָמֵס בְּתוֺךְ מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 22:15\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(19,22,15)\">Ps 22:15</ref>, compare <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>תּוֺרָֽתְךָ בְּתוֺךְ מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 40:9\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"40\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(19,40,9)\">Ps 40:9</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> figurative = seat of emotions: pity, <ref ref=\"Isa 16:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(23,16,11)\">Isa 16:11</ref> (|| <bdbheb>קֶרֶב</bdbheb>); of God's compassion, <ref ref=\"Jer 31:20\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(24,31,20)\">Jer 31:20</ref> (|| <bdbheb>רחם</bdbheb>; in both subject of verb <bdbheb>הָמוּ</bdbheb>); <bdbheb>הֲמוֺן מֵעֶיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 63:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"63\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"63\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,63,15)\">Isa 63:15</ref> (|| <bdbheb>רַחֲמֶיךָ</bdbheb>); distress, <ref ref=\"Jer 4:19\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(24,4,19)\">Jer 4:19</ref> (twice in verse) (|| <bdbheb>לֵב</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>מֵעַי חֳמַרְמָרוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 1:20\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(25,1,20)\">Lam 1:20</ref> (|| <bdbheb>לֵב</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Lam 2:11\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(25,2,11)\">Lam 2:11</ref> (|| <bdbheb>כָּבֵד</bdbheb> <highlight>liver</highlight>); <bdbheb>מֵעַי רֻתְּחוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 30:27\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(18,30,27)\">Job 30:27</ref> (dubious, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Bu')\">Bu</lookup>); love, <bdbheb>מֵעַי הָמוּ עָלָיו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 5:4\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(22,5,4)\">Song 5:4</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> the external belly, <bdbheb>מֵעָיו עֶשֶׁת שֵׁן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Song 5:14\" b=\"22\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(22,5,14)\">Song 5:14</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Isa 16:11", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 16, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Ps 71:6", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 71, "verse": 6}, {"raw": "2Sam 16:11", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 16, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Ps 22:15", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 22, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Ps 40:9", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 40, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Gen 15:4", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 15, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Gen 25:23", "book": "GEN", "chapter": 25, "verse": 23}, {"raw": "Num 5:22", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 5, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "2Sam 20:10", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 20, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Ezek 7:19", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 7, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "2Chr 21:15", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 21, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "2Chr 21:18", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 21, "verse": 18}, {"raw": "2Chr 21:19", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 21, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Job 20:14", "book": "JOB", "chapter": 20, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Ezek 3:3", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 3, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Jonah 2:1", "book": "JON", "chapter": 2, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Jonah 2:2", "book": "JON", "chapter": 2, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "2Sam 7:12", "book": "2SA", "chapter": 7, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Isa 48:19", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 48, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "2Chr 32:21", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 32, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Isa 49:1", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 49, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Ruth 1:11", "book": "RUT", "chapter": 1, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Jer 31:20", "book": "JER", "chapter": 31, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Isa 63:15", "book": "ISA", "chapter": 63, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Jer 4:19", "book": "JER", "chapter": 4, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Lam 1:20", "book": "LAM", "chapter": 1, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "Lam 2:1